BT /F2 13 Tf 54 732.0 Td (4. Acceptable and Permitted Use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 709.0 Td (Sanctioned GenAI may be used to draft and refine documents and code, summarize non-sensitive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 695.0 Td (material, brainstorm ideas, generate test data, translate content, and accelerate research. Team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681.0 Td (members remain fully accountable for all AI-assisted output. You must review, fact-check, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 667.0 Td (validate generated content before relying on or publishing it, as GenAI can produce inaccurate,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 653.0 Td (biased, or fabricated \("hallucinated"\) results. AI-generated code must pass standard security,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 639.0 Td (license-scanning, and quality reviews before merge.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 613.0 Td (5. Prohibited Use and Data Handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 590.0 Td (The following are prohibited:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570.0 Td (- Entering confidential, sensitive, proprietary, or export-controlled information into any GenAI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556.0 Td (  tool not explicitly approved for that data classification. Do not input HPE trade secrets,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542.0 Td (  unreleased financials, source code, or security details into public assistants.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528.0 Td (- Entering personal data, PII, PHI, customer data, or employee records into any tool lacking the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514.0 Td (  requisite privacy and contractual safeguards. Such inputs are prohibited unless the specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 500.0 Td (  tool and use case have been sanctioned for that data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486.0 Td (- Using GenAI output to make consequential decisions about individuals \(hiring, credit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 472.0 Td (  discipline\) without human review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 458.0 Td (- Generating unlawful, harassing, discriminatory, or infringing content, or attempting to bypass) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 444.0 Td (  \("jailbreak"\) tool safety controls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 430.0 Td (- Uploading third-party confidential information received under NDA.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 410.0 Td (When in doubt about whether data may be entered, treat it as prohibited and consult your manager or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396.0 Td (the Privacy Office.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 370.0 Td (6. Training, Awareness, and Guidance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347.0 Td (All team members must complete HPE's mandatory AI acceptable-use training before being granted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 333.0 Td (access to sanctioned tools, and refresher awareness education annually. Role-specific guidance is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 319.0 Td (provided during onboarding for engineering, legal, HR, and customer-facing teams. HPE maintains a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 305.0 Td (Responsible AI resource hub with practical examples, prompt-safety tips, and an escalation path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291.0 Td (Ongoing education and awareness campaigns reinforce safe habits and communicate updates to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277.0 Td (sanctioned-tool list.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 251.0 Td (7. Monitoring, Enforcement, and Violations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 228.0 Td (HPE reserves the right to monitor the use of AI tools and network traffic to detect shadow AI and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 214.0 Td (confirm compliance, consistent with applicable law and local works-council agreements. Violations of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 200.0 Td (this policy may result in disciplinary action up to and including termination of employment or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 186.0 Td (contract, and may carry legal consequences. Suspected data exposure or misuse must be reported) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 172.0 Td (immediately to the Security Operations Center. Enforcement is administered by management in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 158.0 Td (coordination with Human Resources, Security, and Legal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 132.0 Td (8. Governance and Contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 109.0 Td (Questions may be directed to airesponsible@hpe.com or the CISO's office. This board-approved policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 95.0 Td (is reviewed at least annually, or sooner as regulation and technology evolve.) Tj ET
endstream
